msgid "Welcome to the new Pay for Payment."
msgstr "¡Bienvenido al nuevo Pay for Payment!"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated payment method names.
#: src/Admin/UpgradeNotice.php:77
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your fee settings for %s were carried over automatically, so there is "
"nothing to reconfigure, but you might want to double-check."
msgstr ""
"Tus ajustes de cuotas para %s se han trasladado automáticamente, así que no "
"hay nada que volver a configurar, aunque quizá quieras comprobarlos."

#: src/Admin/UpgradeNotice.php:84
