#: build/settings.js:4
msgid ""
"You already have Pro fee rules saved — extra tiers, conditional fees and "
"store-wide fee options — and they're live again. Have a look below so "
"nothing unexpected shows up at checkout or on new orders."
msgstr ""
"Ya tienes guardadas reglas de cuota de Pro — niveles adicionales, cuotas "
"condicionales y opciones para toda la tienda — y vuelven a aplicarse. "
"Míralas abajo para que no aparezca nada inesperado al finalizar la compra ni "
